# Never commit game files or binaries: this project stores only files we create.
*.exe
*.dll
*.bin
*.pak
*.dat
*.DAT
*.vpk
*.rcf
*.p3d
# Extracted or dumped memory / process data
*.dmp
*.dump
*.raw
# Local scratch
/tmp/
*.log

# ...EXCEPT recon evidence, which IS the finding rather than scratch.
#
# ⚠️ Added 2026-09-14 after the blanket *.log above silently swallowed
# dev-archive/recon/2026-09-14-camera-found/ds2_proxy-camera-found.log — the sole
# proof of the whole camera result. The board and two notes cited it as committed
# evidence; git had quietly refused it, and nothing said so. A session that adds a
# log and sees no error has no reason to look further, so this would have kept
# happening to every capture this project ever makes.
#
# Logs anywhere else (the game folder, build/, stray scratch) stay ignored.
!dev-archive/recon/**/*.log
